<view class="app-shell" style="--ui:{{uiScale}}px">
<view wx:if="{{view === 'home'}}" class="home-screen">
  <image class="home-background" src="../../images/titile-bg.png" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="home-scrim"></view>
  <view class="home-top"><text class="home-mark">盘古遗念 · 混沌纪</text></view>
  <view class="home-title-wrap"><text class="home-eyebrow">天地重归混沌</text><text class="home-title">开天一念</text><text class="home-subtitle">一念开天 · 万物新生</text><view class="title-rule"><view></view></view><text class="home-story">盘古神念于混沌中苏醒。四象镇守天地，天道阻断开天之路。\n再一次，你将如何开辟世界？</text></view>
  <view class="home-menu"><button class="start-button" bindtap="openIntro"><text>开始游玩</text><text class="start-arrow">›</text></button><button class="menu-button" bindtap="openSettings">设置</button><view class="home-version">东方玄幻 · 动作肉鸽</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{showIntro}}" class="intro-shade"><view class="intro-card"><text class="intro-kicker">序章 · 混沌初醒</text><text class="intro-title">天地重归混沌</text><scroll-view class="intro-scroll" scroll-y="true"><text class="intro-paragraph">远古之时，盘古开天辟地，以身化作天地万物。岁月流转，众生繁衍，修行者追逐大道，圣人执掌法则。</text><text class="intro-paragraph">后来，圣人之间的争斗席卷天地。神通撕裂山河，至宝震碎星辰，旧世界的根基终于无法支撑。天道降下无量量劫，将万物重新归于混沌，试图阻止崩坏继续蔓延。</text><text class="intro-paragraph">盘古陨落之后留下的一道神念，感知到天地重归混沌，在无边寂静中再度苏醒。它忘却了漫长岁月，只记得心底仍有一件事未曾完成。</text><text class="intro-paragraph">青龙、白虎、朱雀、玄武——盘古四肢所化的四象，厌倦了天地一次次陷入争斗，受天道之命镇守混沌四方，阻止任何存在重开天地。</text><text class="intro-paragraph">击败四象，直面天道。若你能重演地火风水，便可再开天地。至于新世界将走向何方，将由万物自己书写。</text></scroll-view><button class="intro-enter" bindtap="beginGame">踏入混沌</button><button class="intro-back" bindtap="closeIntro">返回</button></view></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{view === 'game'}}" class="screen">
  <view class="topbar">
    <view><text class="brand">开天一念</text><text class="subtitle">盘古遗念 · 混沌试炼</text></view>
    <view class="stats"><text class="hp-stat">元气 {{hp}} / {{maxHp}}</text><text>境界 {{level}}</text></view>
    <button class="game-settings" bindtap="openSettings">设置</button>
  </view>
  <view class="progress"><view class="progress-fill" style="width:{{progress}}%"></view></view>
  <view class="arena stage-{{stage}}">
    <image class="arena-art" src="../../images/arena-{{stage}}.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="arena-vignette"></view><view class="scene-haze haze-one"></view><view class="scene-haze haze-two"></view><view class="scene-ridge ridge-left"></view><view class="scene-ridge ridge-right"></view><view class="scene-sigil">{{stage <= 4 ? '四象镇界' : '天道'}}</view>
    <view class="arena-title">{{stageName}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{hintsOn}}" class="hint">左下摇杆移动 · 松手停止 · 近身自动攻击</view>
    <view wx:if="{{!ended}}" class="attack-range" style="left:{{player.x}}%;top:{{player.y}}%;width:{{attackRange * 2 * uiScale}}px;height:{{attackRange * 2 * uiScale}}px"></view>
    <view wx:for="{{enemies}}" wx:key="id" class="enemy {{item.boss ? 'boss boss-' + item.bossType : ''}} {{item.burnTicks > 0 ? 'enemy-burning' : ''}} {{item.slowTicks > 0 ? 'enemy-slowed' : ''}}" style="left:{{item.x}}%;top:{{item.y}}%"><view class="creature-art-wrap"><image class="creature-art" src="{{item.boss ? '../../images/boss-' + item.bossType + '.png' : '../../images/enemy-wraith.png'}}" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view class="enemy-hp"><view style="width:{{item.hpPct}}%"></view></view></view>
    <view wx:for="{{effects}}" wx:key="id" class="effect effect-{{item.type}}" style="left:{{item.x}}%;top:{{item.y}}%"><view class="hit-ring"></view><view class="hit-flare"></view></view>
    <view class="player {{hurt ? 'player-hurt' : ''}}" style="left:{{player.x}}%;top:{{player.y}}%"><view wx:if="{{!ended}}" class="player-orbit"></view><view class="pangu-frame"><image wx:for="{{actorSheets}}" wx:key="*this" class="pangu-atlas" src="../../images/pangu/{{item}}.png" mode="scaleToFill" style="left:{{actorFrame.left}}px;top:{{actorFrame.top}}px;opacity:{{actorFrame.action === item ? 1 : 0}}"/></view></view>
    <view class="weapon-badge">{{weaponName}} · {{elementName}}</view>
    <view class="combat-stats">{{combatStats}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{message}}" class="toast">{{message}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{!ended}}" class="joystick-pad {{joystick.active ? 'joystick-active' : ''}} {{showChoice || paused ? 'joystick-disabled' : ''}}" catchtouchstart="onTouchStart" catchtouchmove="onTouchMove" catchtouchend="onTouchEnd" catchtouchcancel="onTouchEnd"><view class="joystick-base"><text class="joystick-up">↑</text><text class="joystick-down">↓</text><text class="joystick-left">←</text><text class="joystick-right">→</text></view><view class="joystick-knob" style="margin-left:{{joystick.x * uiScale}}px;margin-top:{{joystick.y * uiScale}}px"></view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{showEnding}}" class="overlay"><view class="choice-panel ending {{won ? 'ending-win' : 'ending-loss'}}"><image class="ending-art" src="{{won ? '../../images/ending-dawn.jpg' : '../../images/arena-5.jpg'}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="ending-shade"></view><text class="ending-kicker">{{won ? '万象初生 · 新纪元' : '神念不灭 · 待重生'}}</text><text class="choice-title">{{endingTitle}}</text><text class="ending-copy">{{endingCopy}}</text><button class="restart" bindtap="restart">再入混沌</button></view></view>
  </view>
  <view class="bottom"><view class="xp-label"><text>灵气</text><text>{{xp}} / {{xpNeed}}</text></view><view class="xp-track"><view class="xp-fill" style="width:{{xpPct}}%"></view></view><view class="bottom-row"><text>法宝：{{weaponName}}</text><text>劫境 {{stage > 4 ? 4 : stage}} / 4</text></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{showChoice}}" class="upgrade-shade" catchtouchmove="stopTap"><view class="choice-panel"><text class="choice-title">境界 {{level + 1}} · 选择提升</text><text class="choice-help">选择一项立即生效，随后继续战斗</text><button wx:for="{{choices}}" wx:key="id" class="choice" data-upgrade-id="{{item.id}}" data-choice-token="{{choiceToken}}" bindtap="chooseUpgrade" bindtouchstart="onUpgradeTouchStart" bindtouchmove="onUpgradeTouchMove" bindtouchend="onUpgradeTouchEnd" bindtouchcancel="onUpgradeTouchCancel"><image class="choice-icon-art" src="../../images/upgrade-{{item.kind}}.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text class="choice-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="choice-desc">{{item.desc}}</text></view><text class="arrow">›</text></button></view></view>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{showSettings}}" class="settings-shade" catchtap="closeSettings"><view class="settings-card" catchtap="stopTap"><text class="settings-title">{{view === 'game' ? '暂停 · 游戏设置' : '游戏设置'}}</text><view wx:if="{{!confirmExit}}"><view class="settings-options"><view class="setting-row"><text>音效</text><switch checked="{{soundOn}}" color="#d6b66c" bindchange="toggleSound" /></view><view class="setting-row"><text>震动反馈</text><switch checked="{{vibrationOn}}" color="#d6b66c" bindchange="toggleVibration" /></view><view class="setting-row"><text>操作提示</text><switch checked="{{hintsOn}}" color="#d6b66c" bindchange="toggleHints" /></view></view><view class="volume-label"><text>音效音量 {{effectVolume}}%</text><button class="sound-preview" disabled="{{!soundOn}}" bindtap="previewSound">试听</button></view><slider class="volume-slider" min="0" max="100" step="5" value="{{effectVolume}}" activeColor="#d6b66c" backgroundColor="#45534d" block-size="20" bindchange="changeVolume"/><view class="settings-actions"><button class="settings-done" bindtap="closeSettings">{{view === 'game' ? '继续游戏' : '完成'}}</button><button wx:if="{{view === 'game'}}" class="exit-game" bindtap="requestExit">退出本局</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{confirmExit}}" class="exit-confirm"><text>退出会结束当前这局游戏，并返回主菜单。</text><view class="settings-actions"><button class="settings-done" bindtap="cancelExit">返回设置</button><button class="exit-game" bindtap="exitToHome">确认退出</button></view></view></view></view>
</view>









